# AgriPredict AI - frontend environment template
#
# HOW TO USE (founder):
#   1. Copy this file and name the copy ".env" (same folder: apps/web/.env)
#   2. Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser,
#      so NEVER put secrets here - anything here is visible to users.
#   3. Phase 1 needs no values at all; the defaults below already work.

# Base path for API requests. The dev server proxies /api to the backend.
VITE_API_BASE_URL=/api
